skill: health
batch: review
preambleRef: protocols/skill-preamble.md
testsPresent: true
enforcementWired: true
beyondUpstream: "Composite weighted 5-signal score (typecheck 30 / tests 30 / lint 20 / dead-code 10 / shellcheck 10) with graceful missing-tool re-normalization (HEALTH_TOOL_MISSING drops the tool and re-weights) plus an appended .loom/health-history.toon trend row; gstack health is a flat pass/fail with no weighting, trend, or degradation handling."
